---
description: Enforce general coding rules for tests to prevent common errors.
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---
- Write tests first, then the code, then run the tests and update the code until tests pass.
- Include appropriate unit tests for all code. Use subdirectories named **`/__tests__/`** inline in the source tree. Everything in a **`/__tests__/`** subdirectory will be treated and run as a test.
- Include appropriate integration tests or end-to-end (e2e) tests in **`/tests`** for all components.